+| `demo` | 3 | 3 | hand scale | illustration only |
+| `easy` | 18 | 24 | 219 | **shipping; held the oracle pool** |
+| `medium` | 24 | 24 | 351 | available, not needed |
+| `hard` | 32 | 24 | 461 | available, not needed |
